Subject: [PATCH] feat(v2): apply fenced Avalanche parking and finality batches
 durably

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Apply fenced native Avalanche parking and finality batches through durable development runtime state, candidate selection and reorg recovery. Native runtime tests cover persistence and failure boundaries; this adds local decision application without implementing Avalanche peer wire exchange.

